        "TileImage": "$($repository e1c8c0a5-a506-45b6-9567-7b6df50b8877).Image",
        "Description": "Hello 47. You are travelling to Dubai to weaken the Network of Providence. Lucy Phillips, a visualist is invited here by Marcus for her own art exhibition, its highly likely she got the positions thanks to her providence connection. Presenting on stage you can find Omar Al -Ghazali, a notorious construction mogul who is working with Carl Ingram. To silence the media Zana Kazeem, a top assasin has also been invited. Destroying the network is a must to continue further operations. Good luck 47.",
